Please list items to be added to the final release comment here

New Features
- `oxi` can now pass payload parameters via JSON
- `oxi alias|token list` shows the certificate subject (--subject), alias
  details in token output and offers options for expired/upcoming items
- Authentication::Base::map_role now accepts an array of roles and uses the
  first one that matches the role_map

Upgrades, Improvements and Bugfixes
- Datapool condition/validator gained a pki_realm parameter to validate
  items in the _global realm
- Datapool API methods no longer enforce cross-realm / sys namespace checks;
  these checks moved into the workflow classes
- `oxi create` now ignores an empty keyfile (needed when redirecting output)
- corrected the Release.key fingerprint in the QUICKSTART documentation

Removals, Deprecations, Breaking Changes
- Datapool cross-realm access and sys* namespace restrictions are now
  enforced by the workflow classes instead of the API layer
